<view class="page rank">
  <scroll-view
    class="chip-bar"
    scroll-x
    enable-flex
    scroll-into-view="chip-{{activeComp}}"
    scroll-with-animation
  >
    <view class="chip-row">
      <view
        wx:for="{{comps}}"
        wx:key="key"
        id="chip-{{item.key}}"
        class="chip {{item.key === activeComp ? 'active' : ''}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="onCompTap"
      >{{item.name}}</view>
    </view>
  </scroll-view>

  <view class="meta" wx:if="{{totalTeams}}">
    <text class="meta-main">{{compName}} · {{totalTeams}} 支球队</text>
    <text class="meta-sub" wx:if="{{updatedAt}}">更新于 {{updatedAt}}{{source ? '（' + source + '）' : ''}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="season-note" wx:if="{{season}}">{{season}}</view>

  <view class="empty" wx:if="{{emptyReason}}">
    <view class="empty-title">没有可展示的积分榜</view>
    <view class="empty-desc">
      {{emptyReason}}
      <block wx:if="{{comps.length}}">
        换一个有积分榜的赛事看看，杯赛和中国国字号本来就没有排名。
      </block>
    </view>
    <view class="empty-btn" bindtap="goSchedule">去看赛程</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="name">
    <view class="group-head" wx:if="{{item.name}}">
      <view class="group-line"></view>
      <view class="group-name">{{item.name}}</view>
      <view class="group-line"></view>
    </view>

    <view class="table card">
      <view class="tr th">
        <view class="th-pos">#</view>
        <view class="th-team">球队</view>
        <view
          wx:for="{{columns}}"
          wx:for-item="col"
          wx:for-index="ci"
          wx:key="key"
          class="td num {{col.strong ? 'strong' : ''}}"
        >{{col.label}}</view>
      </view>

      <view
        wx:for="{{item.rows}}"
        wx:for-item="row"
        wx:key="id"
        class="tr {{row.zoneBg ? 'zoned' : ''}}"
        style="background: {{row.zoneBg}};"
        data-id="{{row.id}}"
        bindtap="onRowTap"
        hover-class="tr-hover"
      >
        <view class="td-pos">
          <text class="pos-num">{{row.pos}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="td-team">
          <view class="team-name">{{row.name}}</view>
        </view>
        <view
          wx:for="{{row.cells}}"
          wx:for-item="cell"
          wx:for-index="ci"
          class="td num {{columns[ci].strong ? 'strong' : ''}}"
        >{{cell}}</view>

        <!-- 区块标签：只画在色带第一行，悬在行顶部与上一行的交界处 -->
        <view wx:if="{{row.zoneFirst}}" class="zone-chip" style="background: {{row.zoneColor}};">
          {{row.zoneLabel}}
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view class="legend" wx:if="{{legend.length}}">
    <block wx:for="{{legend}}" wx:key="label">
      <view class="legend-item" wx:if="{{item.label}}">
        <view class="legend-dot" style="background: {{item.color}}"></view>
        <text>{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>

  <view class="foot-note">
    足球按积分排序，篮球看胜率 —— 两类运动的规则本来就不一样。
    欧战 / 降级分区取自官方标注；电竞榜由已结束的官方赛果实时汇总，赛季刚开始时可能还没生成。
  </view>

  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
